ready: 1
kind: quality
id: stacks.quality.privacy
display_id: QC-STACKS-PRIVACY
module: stacks
title: Memory content leaves the machine only where the owner chose
applies_to: [stacks.rule.model-destination, sync.seq.sync]
measure: Network destinations contacted by any Kernle process and the content sent to each
target: Memory content goes only to the chosen model provider and, for synced stacks, the owner's cloud account. The embedding model download carries no owner data. Nothing else is contacted.
